{"id":"n14094-1-7","stage":3,"title":"실습 · 实习","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14094-1-7-1","ko":"간호 대학의 학생들은 전공 실습을 어떻게 하나요?","zh":"护理学院的学生们是如何进行专业实习的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"간호","meaning":"看护，护理","explanation":"간호：看护，护理","readings":[{"term":"간호","audio":"/audio/88a3a2188bbb227cf31c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14869","senseId":"1","lemma":"간호","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대학의","meaning":"学院","explanation":"대학：学院；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"대학","audio":"/audio/a5aac0eac3be8a9556cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61281","senseId":"2","lemma":"대학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학생들은","meaning":"学生","explanation":"학생：学生；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"학생","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31670","senseId":"1","lemma":"학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전공","meaning":"战功","explanation":"전공：战功","readings":[{"term":"전공","audio":"/audio/7c867cf5c98f49ab2c43.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74051","senseId":"1","lemma":"전공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"실습을","meaning":"实习","explanation":"실습：实习；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"실습","audio":"/audio/833b1238fea61118e1c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14094","senseId":"1","lemma":"실습","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하나요?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"88a3a2188bbb227c","term":"간호","zh":"看护，护理","audio":"/audio/88a3a2188bbb227cf31